Third-party components
----------------------

unitcalcs imports, but does not redistribute, the following packages. They
carry their own licences and are installed separately by pip or by your TeX
distribution:

    handcalcs      Apache License 2.0
    forallpeople   Apache License 2.0
    PythonTeX      LaTeX Project Public License
    fancyvrb       LaTeX Project Public License
    amsmath        LaTeX Project Public License

The LPPL is compatible with using these components in this way.
